       }
      ],
      "text": "Basic labs for any sus ingestion:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " CMP; acetaminophen, salicylate and ethanol levels; lactate and blood gas; UA; urine toxicology screen."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
